# Betawi booking keys for testing on this PC. This file is git-ignored: it never goes into git.
# Fill the values yourself. The same six names go into Cloudflare Pages (Settings, Variables and
# Secrets, add each as a Secret) so the live site can use them. Any part left empty is skipped.
# How to get each value: BOOKING-SETUP.md

# 1. Telegram alert to the restaurant, with one-tap WhatsApp reply buttons
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# 2. Google Sheet row and Calendar event (the Apps Script in google-sheet/Code.gs)
SHEET_WEBHOOK_URL=
SHEET_SECRET=

# 3. Notion card in a bookings database
NOTION_TOKEN=
NOTION_DB_ID=
